WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.850
Lab 2 runs the guide's validate steps
in a test tenant, never production.

2
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.850
The authors haven't run
them, as the page says.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:12.175
Every step reads, apart from the evidence
files it writes in your own folder.

4
00:00:12.175 --> 00:00:15.770
You need Module 1's test tenant,
reader account and test device,

5
00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:19.858
an account that can view the Defender
portal's settings, and the ladder

6
00:00:19.858 --> 00:00:24.087
decision record for the test tenant, or
the guide's Step 9 as the reference.

7
00:00:24.087 --> 00:00:26.437
Step one runs on the test device.

8
00:00:26.437 --> 00:00:31.063
It's Microsoft Learn's command that reads
the sensor version from the registry.

9
00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:35.024
Contain user needs ten point
eight four seven zero or later.

10
00:00:35.024 --> 00:00:38.762
Step two is a click path in the
Defender portal for your cloud.

11
00:00:38.762 --> 00:00:44.026
Open the devices page under automated
responses and note each device group's level.

12
00:00:44.026 --> 00:00:47.825
Then open the identities page
and note the excluded users.

13
00:00:47.825 --> 00:00:50.263
Compare both with the
ladder decision record.

14
00:00:50.263 --> 00:00:53.466
The guide's pass: every
server group at a semi level,

15
00:00:53.466 --> 00:00:57.138
every workstation group at
full or a recorded exception,

16
00:00:57.138 --> 00:01:01.250
and the emergency access accounts
in the identity exclusions.
